+# assets/scripts/polecat-workspace.sh's base-resolve mode (GUARD base-resolve).
 # Sets DEFAULT_REF to the fully-qualified ref for the rig's default_branch. Both
 # arms name refs/remotes/ and refs/heads/ outright, because git resolves a
 # same-named tag ahead of a bare branch name.
diff --git a/gastown/formulas/mol-polecat-work.toml b/gastown/formulas/mol-polecat-work.toml
index 5bca5e3b..2014746e 100644
--- a/gastown/formulas/mol-polecat-work.toml
+++ b/gastown/formulas/mol-polecat-work.toml
@@ -124,38 +124,21 @@ This order — remote, then local, else stop — is the same contract
 base selection of its own; keep the two halves in step, or they will
 disagree about what "the base" means.
 
+Run the block below as ONE Bash call, exactly as written. It runs the pack's
+workspace script (`assets/scripts/polecat-workspace.sh base-resolve`) in YOUR
+shell: the script is sourced, not executed, so `$BASE_REF` is set for the
+blocks below exactly as the inline block set it. Do not retype the script or
+read it first.
+
 ```bash
